          "text": "\"GRACE: Grounded Reasoning via Adapter Composition and Evidence-Aware Calibration for Educational Visual Question Answering\" proposes We introduce GRACE (Grounded Reasoning via Adapter Composition and Evidence-Aware Calibration), a framework that uses each question’s pedagogical state to specialize lightweight language and vision adaptation.",
