          "context": "Method/system claim as reported by the authors in the inspected body; not independently reproduced."
        },
        {
          "text": "Evaluation as reported: The SmartSolve methodology, as applied to linear algebra, starts with a discovery process that systematically evaluates various algorithms—such as the aforementioned banded LU and KLU—across a diverse set of matrix patterns from Matrix Depot [ 5 ] , such as Hilbert, Vandermonde, ",
          "evidence_class": "AUTHOR_CLAIM",
