        },
        {
          "text": "Evaluation as reported: Prior empirical work evaluates LLM refactoring using combinations of code-smell reduction, static quality metrics, and unit-test success [ 6 ] , while recent repository-level benchmarks emphasize compilation, test execution, and automated refactoring detection as stronger validat",
          "evidence_class": "AUTHOR_CLAIM",
