        },
        {
          "text": "Evaluation as reported: Given a calibration dataset and model checkpoint, SAEM evaluates candidate markers according to their contribution to stage-level expert activation coherence, measured by the temporal coherence metric T ​ C seq TC_{\\text{seq}} introduced in Section III .",
          "evidence_class": "AUTHOR_CLAIM",
