        },
        {
          "text": "Maker-reported result (not a publication-grade fact): As a result, SAEM still achieves a 1.62 × \\times throughput improvement over Mixtral-Offloading despite less frequent cache updates.",
          "evidence_class": "AUTHOR_CLAIM",
